# 11Handle — optional provider bootstrap (copy to .env.local and fill in)
# .env.local is gitignored. NEVER commit a live key.

# ── Provider bootstrap (optional) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Point HANDLE_DEMO_BASE at any OpenAI-compatible endpoint, or use a key directly.
HANDLE_DEMO_BASE=/th-api/v1
HANDLE_DEMO_MODEL=
HANDLE_DEMO_KEY=

# ── Exam / learning keys (optional) ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Exams can borrow the demo provider, or use dedicated keys via env / UI.
# HANDLE_OPENAI_API_KEY=

# ── Browser service (optional overrides) ──────────────────────────────────────
# The browser service ships INSIDE the product and is materialized on first use.
# These only point it somewhere non-default. MJ_* names remain accepted as
# legacy fallbacks (docs/history/LEGACY-COMPAT.md).
# HANDLE_BROWSER_URL=http://127.0.0.1:9223
# HANDLE_BROWSER_DIR=
# HANDLE_BROWSER_NODE=
# HANDLE_BROWSER_BIN=            # a Chromium-family browser, if not on PATH
